\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Implicit escalation threshold $p^*$ (left) and self-estimated accuracy $\hat  {a}$ (right) for each model. The threshold $p^*$ varies widely (53\% to over 100\%), while self-estimated accuracy ranges from 76\% to 97\%. The dotted lines show the optimal threshold $\tau ^* = 75\%$ at cost ratio $R = 4$ (left) and average actual accuracy (right).}}{13}{figure.caption.18}\protected@file@percent }
